# Headers for Netlify and Cloudflare Pages (other hosts: send the same three
# on every response, or rely on isolation-sw.js). The game's threads need a
# cross-origin isolated page. no-cache: revalidated each visit (the file names
# do not change between builds).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Cache-Control: no-cache
